<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Who is He in deep distress,</l><l>Fasting in the wilderness?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Who is He the people bless</l><l>For His words of gentleness?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Who is He to whom they bring</l><l>All the sick and sorrowing?</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Who is He that stands and weeps</l><l>At the grave where Lazarus sleeps?</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Who is He the gathering throng</l><l>Greet with loud triumphant song?</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Lo! at midnight, who is He</l><l>Prays in dark Gethsemane?</l></lg>
<lg label="8."><l>Who is He on yonder tree</l><l>Dies in grief and agony?</l></lg>
<lg label="9."><l>Who is He who from the grave</l><l>Comes to succor, help, and save?</l></lg>
<lg label="10."><l>Who is He who from His throne</l><l>Rules through all the worlds alone?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
